This warning is harmless. I just changed the text to
"Adapted sites library used for vector points (module should be updated to GRASS 6 vector library)."

which is hopefully more explanative. It is intended to the programmer.

Concerning memory faults: I found this in the ChangeLog

2005-08-24 16:06  markus
        * lib/sites/sites.c: Brad's updates merged ;crash fixed (gstat
          related)


To replicate the problem I would need a (small) location, the
gstat script etc, preferably off-list. I can try to check although
I am pretty busy right now.

Markus

